    "detailed_description": "<h1>Wishlist now</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeon-Pix is in development, wishlist now to follow the journey and be first to escape the dungeon!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeon-Pix</strong> is a stylized VR dungeon escape game filled with puzzles, minigames and physical interactions only possible in virtual reality</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up deep inside a forgotten dungeon and the only way out is forward<br>Solve environmental puzzles, avoid traps, and face strange enemies using motion-based mechanics<br>Everything in the world is designed to be touched grabbed or dodged with your own hands</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No static menus here<br>Activate your 3D menu by crossing your hands<br>Reload your gun by pointing it at the ground<br>Drop it and it floats back up to meet you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Current features include</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully immersive VR interaction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A growing collection of unique minigames</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A heartbeat-based health system that reacts to damage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Floating weapon recovery and motion-based reload</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized low-poly art with a dark fantasy atmosphere</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeon-Pix is currently in development and will continue to evolve based on feedback<br>Join the journey and help shape the dungeon</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeon-Pix</strong> is a stylized VR dungeon escape game filled with puzzles, minigames and physical interactions only possible in virtual reality</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up deep inside a forgotten dungeon and the only way out is forward<br>Solve environmental puzzles, avoid traps, and face strange enemies using motion-based mechanics<br>Everything in the world is designed to be touched grabbed or dodged with your own hands</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No static menus here<br>Activate your 3D menu by crossing your hands<br>Reload your gun by pointing it at the ground<br>Drop it and it floats back up to meet you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Current features include</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully immersive VR interaction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A growing collection of unique minigames</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A heartbeat-based health system that reacts to damage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Floating weapon recovery and motion-based reload</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized low-poly art with a dark fantasy atmosphere</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeon-Pix is currently in development and will continue to evolve based on feedback<br>Join the journey and help shape the dungeon</p>",
    "short_description": "A stylized VR dungeon escape game where you solve puzzles, dodge traps and fight enemies using motion-based mechanics. Every object is physical and interactive. Designed from the ground up for virtual reality.",
